  <ID>LOST_FOG</ID>

  <!--Entry for the concert hall -->
  <Entry>
    <ID>CONCERT_HALL_ENTRY_FC</ID>
    <Name>Concert Hall</Name>
    <Curiosity>HEARTHIANS_CAMPS</Curiosity>

    <!--Learn about the vocal organs-->
    <ExploreFact>
      <ID>DREE_SINGING_FACT_FC</ID>
      <IgnoreMoreToExplore/>
      <Text>The Nomai theorized that the aliens may have specialized singing organs.</Text>
    </ExploreFact>

    <!--One of the Nomai be translating-->
    <ExploreFact>
      <ID>CONCERT_MISSED_FACT_FC</ID>
      <Text>One of the Nomai did not attend the show, as he was busy translating the alien's language in a lab.</Text>
    </ExploreFact>

    <!--There sure do be bells-->
    <ExploreFact>
      <ID>CONCERT_BELLS_FACT_FC</ID>
      <Text>There are five large bells near the stage, with a hexagonal slot above each. The leftmost bell is broken on the ground.</Text>
    </ExploreFact>

    <!--I'm illiterate-->
    <ExploreFact>
      <ID>CONCERT_DREE_TEXT_FACT_FC</ID>
      <Text>There is text alluding to a way to fix gravity crystals, but not all of the text is written in Nomai.</Text>
    </ExploreFact>

    <!--Combination-->
    <ExploreFact>
      <ID>CONCERT_COMBO_FACT_FC</ID>
      <Text>To fix the gravity crystal, it needs to be socketed into one of the hexagonal slots. Then three bells need to be rung: the one two spots to the left, the one directly to the right, and finally the one directly below.</Text>
    </ExploreFact>

    <!--Success!-->
    <ExploreFact>
      <ID>CONCERT_SUCCESS_FACT_FC</ID>
      <Text>I was able to fix a gravity crystal!</Text>
    </ExploreFact>
  </Entry>
  
